       "id": "1a.1",
       "text": "A warehouse fire broke out at the Kellet Point industrial estate in Osmery on December 2, 2025, with the site operator Fallon Coatings deploying by mid-morning.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.2",
       "text": "Kellet Road was closed through the industrial estate and at Merrin Canal, and warnings were issued for Brayle and then Sunder Flats as the incident developed.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.3",
       "text": "No casualties were reported in the window; a mandatory evacuation of Brayle moved about 2,300 residents, with a separate figure of 48 also circulating.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.4",
       "text": "By evening the evacuation had extended to Osmery, with the road closure and warnings remaining in force and no cause yet given.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
